{'symbol': 'BG', 'date': '2023-04-10 00:01:00', 'title': 'BUNGE TO ACQUIRE LOUISIANA STATE-OF-THE-ART REFINERY FROM FUJI OIL ENHANCING ITS POSITION IN THE VEGETABLE OILS MARKET', 'text': "ST. LOUIS--(BUSINESS WIRE)--BUNGE (NYSE: BG), A GLOBAL LEADER IN AGRIBUSINESS, FOOD AND INGREDIENTS, THROUGH ITS BUNGE LODERS CROKLAAN JV WITH IOI CORPORATION BERHAD (KLSE: IOICORP), HAS ENTERED INTO A DEFINITIVE ASSET PURCHASE AGREEMENT WITH FUJI OIL NEW ORLEANS, LLC (FUJI OIL) TO ACQUIRE ITS NEWLY CONSTRUCTED, PORT-BASED REFINERY LOCATED IN IMTT'S (INTERNATIONAL-MATEX TANK TERMINALS) AVONDALE TERMINAL, LOUISIANA."}